cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use DBScale in research, cite it as below.
type: software
title: DBScale
abstract: >-
  Database scalability experimentation framework. DBScale inspects a database
  read-only, builds an isolated synthetic copy, scales that copy, runs your
  SQL, and reports where performance breaks.
authors:
  - name: The DBScale Authors
repository-code: https://github.com/kok32gold/dbscale
url: https://github.com/kok32gold/dbscale
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
keywords:
  - database
  - postgresql
  - benchmark
  - scalability
  - synthetic-data
